---
title: "pi-run: one run of an id"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: no run
  s1: running
  s2: exited, failed wake
  s3: exited, no wake
  s4: exited, done wake
  s5: lost
  s6: collected
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: pi-run #60;id> #60;role> #60;brief>
  s1 --> s2: pi exits rc != 0
  s1 --> s3: pi exits rc 0 [no wake: finish]
  s1 --> s5: KILL or OOM
  s1 --> s4: pi exits rc 0 [brief has wake: finish]
  s2 --> s6: pi-run collect #60;id>
  s3 --> s6: pi-run collect #60;id>
  s4 --> s6: pi-run collect #60;id>
  s5 --> s6: pi-run collect #60;id>
  s6 --> s1: pi-run #60;id> #60;role> #60;brief>
